<title>USA: TWA launches cargo services.</title>
<headline>TWA launches cargo services.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trans World Airlines Inc said Monday it unveiled two new additions to its cargo services, which will go into effect June 15.</p>
<p>TWA said it is launching NFO Life, a specialized premium service for urgent medical shipments, and $hipper Saver, which will provide second-day morning service through the United States.</p>
<p>TWA said NFO Life and $hipper Saver complement its other cargo services, which include NFO Small Package Express Service, NFO International, Priority Air Express and the Perishable Products program.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
